    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms ministry, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
